{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"malet_reward","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_calculating"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"Three things. Listen carefully.","text_ko":"세 가지입니다. 잘 들으세요."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_calculating"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"First, a route. Through the Crumbling Coast. I've scouted it three times. It leads to someone who knows where BL-07 breathes.","text_ko":"첫째, 경로. 무너지는 해안을 지나는 길입니다. 세 번 직접 정찰했죠. BL-07이 숨 쉬는 곳을 아는 사람에게 닿습니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_calculating"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"Second, a name. Sable. Find her at the Seam, northeast of here. Follow the colors. You'll understand when you see it.","text_ko":"둘째, 이름. 세이블. 여기서 북동쪽, 씸에서 찾으세요. 색을 따라가면 됩니다. 보면 이해하실 겁니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_warning"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"Third, a warning.","text_ko":"셋째, 경고."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"He paused. For the first time, something moved behind those amber eyes.","text_ko":"그가 멈칫했다. 처음으로, 그 호박색 눈 뒤에서 무언가가 움직였다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_warning"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"An Editor has been dispatched. Name: Kairos. Quiet. Methodical. You have four days before he closes the distance.","text_ko":"에디터가 파견됐습니다. 이름은 카이로스. 조용하고. 질서정연하죠. 그가 거리를 봉쇄하기까지 나흘 남았습니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/archive_ch2_information_price_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Elia's hand tightened on her cup. Her knuckles went white.","text_ko":"엘리아의 손이 잔을 조여 쥐었다. 손마디가 하얗게 질렸다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_reward/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"We need to leave. Now.","text_ko":"떠나야 해. 지금."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"e331828fa67026613b77b6590af9f8cfc8a6e60c26aa96e77aa97804be831b59","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
